{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dChinese Horror\uff5cAuthentic Rural Folktales</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1990s rural China, without TV or internet, people gathered to share firsthand supernatural encounters. &quot;Phantom Reckoning&quot; brings these oral traditions to life, transporting you to that mysterious era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dImmersive Experience\uff5cFirst-Person 90s Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses first-person perspective to meticulously recreate 1990s environments - from peeling hospital walls to antiquated medical equipment. Based on real accounts, you'll experience bone-chilling moments firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dNarrative-Driven Puzzles\uff5cTruth Hidden in Folklore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With rich storytelling, each chapter presents different supernatural events like dream messages and ghost walls. To solve these, you must deeply understand the plot, analyze relationships, and utilize folk customs and special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dRetro Art Style\uff5cBlurred Yet Real Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique visual style that preserves PS1-era angularity while adding modern lighting. Scenes resemble half-remembered nightmares of that old hospital - authentically rough yet unsettlingly real.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W / A / S / D: Move\u2003\u2003Mouse: Look Around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Interact / Dialogue / Use Held Item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click: Submit item to NPC or place held item (make sure to choose a flat surface or a specific container, e.g., noodles go in the pot~)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W / S: Navigate dialogue options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D: Confirm selection</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nightmare Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/88f5a20986c8a812515bb91437ca9dd0e821f0cf.jpg"},{"name":"Soul Under the Blade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/0a78b46af0e5f4ba2ee923d7a0cb58f87c6db46a.jpg"},{"name":"Revenant Revealed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/6f33aca12f6f85811697d56484317c353d8bfb07.jpg"},{"name":"Dream Dweller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/9311e13be9c1178f56db167b722a5e0acb124422.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/386647f8129ec59b99f02dd0507e33c261991c0d.jpg"},{"name":"Grenade to the Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/883b8d4d88d5f463db0f4396f8635fc5342fb1d1.jpg"},{"name":"Chamberpot Execution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640040/bc76b4879502ba33474925be03a41c0e29fda58e.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640040?t=1747961199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640040?t=1747961199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640040/3d8c87419f932d24f0e12140a686b46bcb3ae6e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747961199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640040/3d8c87419f932d24f0e12140a686b46bcb3ae6e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747961199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dChinese Horror\uff5cAuthentic Rural Folktales</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1990s rural China, without TV or internet, people gathered to share firsthand supernatural encounters. &quot;Phantom Reckoning&quot; brings these oral traditions to life, transporting you to that mysterious era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dImmersive Experience\uff5cFirst-Person 90s Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses first-person perspective to meticulously recreate 1990s environments - from peeling hospital walls to antiquated medical equipment. Based on real accounts, you'll experience bone-chilling moments firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dNarrative-Driven Puzzles\uff5cTruth Hidden in Folklore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With rich storytelling, each chapter presents different supernatural events like dream messages and ghost walls. To solve these, you must deeply understand the plot, analyze relationships, and utilize folk customs and special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258dRetro Art Style\uff5cBlurred Yet Real Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique visual style that preserves PS1-era angularity while adding modern lighting. Scenes resemble half-remembered nightmares of that old hospital - authentically rough yet unsettlingly real.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W / A / S / D: Move\u2003\u2003Mouse: Look Around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Interact / Dialogue / Use Held Item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click: Submit item to NPC or place held item (make sure to choose a flat surface or a specific container, e.g., noodles go in the pot~)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W / S: Navigate dialogue options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D: Confirm selection</p>","developers":["Archimedes Nicholas Xia"],"genres":[{"de